<title>USA: Algos Pharmaceutical Q1 loss widens.</title>
<headline>Algos Pharmaceutical Q1 loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>NEPTUNE, N.J. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		 1997</p>
<p> Revenues				 $     nil	 $	 nil</p>
<p> Net loss				 (567,965)	 (3,224,778)</p>
<p> Net loss per common share	     (0.05)		(0.20)</p>
<p> Weighted shares outstanding     12,210,769	  15,780,288</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
<p>Notes: Algos Pharmaceutical Corp said total Q1 operating expenses were $3.8 million vs $0.6 million a year ago. The rise in costs reflects the anticipated increase in product development activities following an initial public offering that closed in October 1996, the company said.</p>
